<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">UK inflation accelerated by more than expe=
cted to 3.5% in September as the cost of motor fuels soared at the fastest =
rate in four years.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The Office for National Statistics said an=
nual inflation, measured by the consumer prices index, rose <a href=3D"http=
s://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.5EvR0nnoZ0EI0sGdYUHnEBrX92Ff=
0Wp9SQ124Cje-bwydRgNkSO4TTEB2ON_FVkOU5pyu-Ih7Z2wUymHlUTpJHmafWUWuQz2R_SOdk_=
RaUPGCqtqfg0vPtlw-r3vUGpDGotwuRNN3hnX_KhiQffJJgewMhYqiABydzr3WH7okqncuAjRhR=
yEGIc1gHrr9JL0a-AVM5CSB4RK--Md5aqZbBBxZLg4xCmlbTupHnD1U87sdjgOf8jzUCzZNbZcl=
vESD1Ck06jubLb0zZCRU__VLjKW9XIWky7vgUvj-apxpORRQacAqOjaHeeS_wAqakqpGgdvv6Gq=
VHCPIPtH_CfEcw/4v2/fxKKvZtOSXuDF__QqLOtlg/h30/h001.46TWqIW7balj10IV-CSFSxqy=
rzewjAgeVGg8OxcTaMg" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">from 3.1% in August</a>. Eco=
nomists had forecast a rise to 3.4%.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The ONS said the biggest factor pushing up=
 inflation was transport, in particular motor fuels, while restaurants and =
hotels made the largest, partly offsetting, downward contribution.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The motor fuel inflation rate was the high=
est since August 2022.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Core CPI (excluding volatile energy, food,=
 alcohol, and tobacco costs) rose by 2.8% in the 12 months to September, up=
 from 2.6% in August.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Oil and gas prices have soared since the e=
nd of February when the US and Israel <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.t=
heguardian.com/ss/c/u001.5EvR0nnoZ0EI0sGdYUHnEBrX92Ff0Wp9SQ124Cje-bxIiKx8Jb=
huRyK-wh01kQkriolUiyE3JVDy_Jbx8vBo44H7zm8ee1iblX4-g_yBAWtJXKBmaE8IiZsbjfK8a=
N6y2qlOHcYn7L3193DX2yPesLlNmaehPN0RWMo0Gj0131c_pF3r2kHSkQNAFiQt0BFY8hComKXa=
JmGbGRYNZ4Wo8P9DtUrZ45mQm-9rZctAWho6tSTi012N-cR9Gi8R_HljcIHSP2WSeM7vl8DlgOp=
LbshLM1_WrP8qgn82HMZNkGYPlHRagOicCm9CFH_q1W9Q/4v2/fxKKvZtOSXuDF__QqLOtlg/h3=
1/h001.406oQx0HNOaKC6NjpOlUGpcyAdg8mkRhvYMidrpmQwE" style=3D"color: #0077B6=
;">launched their war on Iran</a>. The practical closure of the strait of H=
ormuz to most fossil fuel traffic since then has sent the price of Brent cr=
ude well north of $100 a barrel.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Petrol prices have climbed above =C2=A31.7=
0, while the cost of a litre of diesel has also risen, hitting a record hig=
h of <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.5EvR0nno=
Z0EI0sGdYUHnEBrX92Ff0Wp9SQ124Cje-bydMS3hLD8RogHRgDDuEDAJm42pQG6LT0ycMz6lU6p=
55NTwC_GPeVDa74DMg4uwKGPZvGZdRBG3UxoFab-kfHD6r-H_YY5zcrPtZAVyBf0dMtUoWLd30G=
SUV-nDX0-rVcMnnvnDI09I-jnrpN2mz645POci4JdByWOACutewA4iPKHau8Rjbwm7z8X51dkDZ=
_nvV0Dm0I5DOWFjgMrBhlf4XD9cdGqCL-WYc7pLtkyq4p1V0RUNxcaxl31lsJdWGlM/4v2/fxKK=
vZtOSXuDF__QqLOtlg/h32/h001.jtp3d4FNxv-v1hx-uLw6mJHQ8tmz_nI0FNfPukufY-4" st=
yle=3D"color: #0077B6;">more than =C2=A32 a litre</a> this month.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Bank of England officials are widely forec=
ast to raise interest rates when they meet next month, with concerns that i=
nflation will jump above 4% next year =E2=80=93 more than double the centra=
l bank=E2=80=99s 2% target rate.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The UK government has approved the controv=
ersial Jackdaw gasfield in the North Sea, a widely expected move that will =
nonetheless dismay environmental campaigners and a number of Labour MPs.</p=
>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The energy secretary, Miatta Fahnbulleh, s=
aid the project will start supplying gas to homes and businesses from the e=
nd of this month.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">At the same time, she said a new energy we=
alth fund will be set up by the government with a =C2=A32bn down payment to=
 reinvest oil and gas revenues into the climate transition, away from fossi=
l fuels.</p>
